{"key":"rabin-karp-5a776ffd901f1c3d","sourceHash":"5a776ffd901f1c3d1d99f4173ed589da9a6c891c5f8b1c079142c465f49837c6","pattern":"rabin-karp","category":"strings-tries","title":"Rabin–Karp: Mental Model","idea":"Compare rolling hashes first and verify actual bytes only on hash matches.","complexity":"O(n+m) expected · O(n*m) collision worst","source":"fn csv<T: std::fmt::Display>(a: impl IntoIterator<Item = T>) -> String {\n    a.into_iter()\n        .map(|x| x.to_string())\n        .collect::<Vec<_>>()\n        .join(\",\")\n}\nfn rolling_matches(text: &str, pattern: &str) -> Vec<usize> {\n    let (a, p) = (text.as_bytes(), pattern.as_bytes());\n    let m = p.len();\n    if m == 0 {\n        return (0..=a.len()).collect();\n    }\n    if m > a.len() {\n        return Vec::new();\n    }\n    let (base, modulus) = (257_u64, 1_000_000_007_u64);\n    let mut power = 1;\n    for _ in 1..m {\n        power = power * base % modulus;\n    }\n    let (mut wanted, mut hash) = (0, 0);\n    for i in 0..m {\n        wanted = (wanted * base + p[i] as u64) % modulus;\n        hash = (hash * base + a[i] as u64) % modulus;\n    }\n    let mut out = Vec::new();\n    for i in 0..=a.len() - m {\n        if hash == wanted && &a[i..i + m] == p {\n            out.push(i);\n        } // verify collisions\n        if i + m < a.len() {\n            hash = ((hash + modulus - a[i] as u64 * power % modulus) * base + a[i + m] as u64)\n                % modulus;\n        }\n    }\n    out\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = csv(rolling_matches(\"abracadabra\", \"abra\"));\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":8,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"let (a, p) = (text.as_bytes(), pattern.as_bytes());"},{"line":9,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"let m = p.len();"},{"line":10,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"if m == 0 {"},{"line":11,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"return (0..=a.len()).collect();"},{"line":13,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"if m > a.len() {"},{"line":14,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"return Vec::new();"},{"line":16,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"let (base, modulus) = (257_u64, 1_000_000_007_u64);"},{"line":17,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"let mut power = 1;"},{"line":18,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"for _ in 1..m {"},{"line":19,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"power = power * base % modulus;"},{"line":20,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"}"},{"line":21,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"let (mut wanted, mut hash) = (0, 0);"},{"line":22,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"for i in 0..m {"},{"line":23,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"wanted = (wanted * base + p[i] as u64) % modulus;"},{"line":24,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"hash = (hash * base + a[i] as u64) % modulus;"},{"line":25,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"}"},{"line":26,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"let mut out = Vec::new();"},{"line":27,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"for i in 0..=a.len() - m {"},{"line":28,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"if hash == wanted && &a[i..i + m] == p {"},{"line":29,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"out.push(i);"},{"line":30,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"}"},{"line":31,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"if i + m < a.len() {"},{"line":32,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"hash = ((hash + modulus - a[i] as u64 * power % modulus) * base + a[i + m] as u64)"},{"line":34,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"}"},{"line":36,"function":"rolling_matches","statement":"out"},{"line":40,"function":"main","statement":"let result = csv(rolling_matches(\"abracadabra\", \"abra\"));"},{"line":41,"function":"main","statement":"println!(\"{result}\");"},{"line":42,"function":"main","statement":"}"}],"version":1,"input":"text=abracadabra pattern=abra","stdout":"0,7\n","values":[{"type":"&str","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"\"abracadabra\""}},{"type":"&